to conspire with a judge

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:43.770
to decide what the potential outcome

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:45.540
of this case is going to be,

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:47.010
but it's kind of like arbitration,

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.770
